# The libm built-ins (B20): what libm gives at full accuracy and a
# library cannot write as well. Each takes any number and gives a
# Float, item by item: t_anh (no cancellation near 0, no overflow at
# 1000), s_qrt (the correctly rounded root), e_xpm1 and l_og1p (exact
# near 0, where e_xp x - 1 and l_og 1 + x lose every digit), e_rf and
# e_rfc (the Gauss error function and its complement).
== SOURCE
t_anh 0.5 1e-10 1000
s_qrt 2 16
e_xpm1 1e-10
(e_xp 1e-10) - 1
l_og1p 1e-10
e_rf 0 0.5 3
e_rfc 0.5 10
0.5 * 1 + e_rf 1 / s_qrt 2
== TYPE
Float
Float
Float
Float
Float
Float
Float
Float
